    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49560" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύσθλα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sacred implements of Bacchic
				orgies</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.134
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύσθλοις παιομένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					7.209d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the Bacchic festival itself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>: also in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.501f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> generally,
				<i>sacrifice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. καταίθειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					459
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				720
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				929
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				904
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
